## 15. Limitations and exact next implication

This is a small, deliberately stratified feasibility pilot. It estimates whether the fixed recovery operator produces heterogeneous within-prefix causal outcomes under the frozen SFT continuation policy; it does not estimate natural intervention frequency, family-level significance, or selector performance.

The formal R4 pilot is complete. No selector, DPO, ORPO, additional recovery examples, or further ALFWorld inference is started by this run.

